# Terraform state holds every secret value in plaintext regardless of a
# variable's `sensitive` flag (autumn release init --target
# azure-container-apps). Docker's build context is whatever the positional
# path argument points at — building from `.` after `terraform apply` would
# otherwise upload terraform.tfstate straight into the builder/build cache
# even though no stage ever COPYs it into the final image.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
